#: scenario6:scenario6_2A3AC17A_E894_4E74_BCFF_D6E41BE5D3FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d0e1fcef3ee9281e2640503886b7f5240da594251d5f96ed228bb8f17e78280
