msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He wasn’t deranged—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫his surroundings were.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫His environment, the people "
"around him, his whole world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non era lui lo squilibrato—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ma tutto ciò che lo circondava.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il suo "
"habitat, le persone attorno a lui, il suo intero mondo."

